Error [jet.ReadOnlyValueNotOwned]: `m` was not moved here, so its contents cannot be taken apart
  --> tests/ui/pattern_escaped_borrow.jet:12:8
    |
 12 |     if m == {
    |        ^
 Why: `m` grants read-only access to `Msg`, so its non-copyable parts cannot be taken out of it
 Fix: Change the parameter to `m: &&Msg` to take ownership, or inspect it without binding its contents
